The '''Mud Pits''' were located at the [[Skull Ridge Mountain Hotel & Spa]] on the [[planet]] [[Lanupa]] during the [[New Republic Era]].<ref name="You Have a Lot to Learn About Pirates" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The Mud Pits first appeared in "[[You Have a Lot to Learn About Pirates]]"<ref name="You Have a Lot to Learn About Pirates" /> the fifth episode of the live-action [[Disney+]] series ''[[Star Wars: Skeleton Crew]]'', which aired on [[December 24]], [[2024]].<ref name="Twitter">{{Twitter|StarWars|status/1861409832349172011|[[Star Wars]]|date=2024-11-26|quote=Mark your calendars. 🗓️ On December 2, stream the two-episode series premiere of #SkeletonCrew, only on @DisneyPlus.|archiveurl=https://archive.ph/QwMYe}}</ref>

